			<div class="content" id="post-content-2366591">
									

<p>During Operation Cross, there were supposed to be three testes: &quot;Able&quot;, &quot;Baker&quot;, and &quot;Charlie&quot;. &quot;Charlie&quot; was not followed through with.</p>
<p>I honestly wasn't thinking when I picked the name &quot;Renz&quot;. In keeping with naming patterns, I could name it &quot;Charlie&quot; and then say that the Foundation used the unexploded bomb as a cover story, or I could pick a name that begins with &quot;D&quot;. I think I prefer the new name though, and have renamed the test &quot;Dillan&quot;.</p>

